Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.27,0:00:04.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你們升級了呢！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.15,0:00:06.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,恭喜！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.15,0:00:10.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們一起變強了喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.97,0:00:14.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣的話 你們兩個只要再完成升級任務
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.77,0:00:16.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就能升成銅等級冒險者囉
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.45,0:00:18.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,銅等級？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.52,0:00:21.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是冒險者的階級啦
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.50,0:00:22.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,東雲先生
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,難得有這機會
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.62,0:00:26.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要不要接一下升級任務？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.62,0:00:28.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,把這座地下城攻略掉！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.12,0:00:32.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這裡是已經決定要廢棄的地下城
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.35,0:00:34.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但還需要做最後調查
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.85,0:00:38.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要是能一起把升級任務完成\N就能一次搞定了！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.77,0:00:41.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你還真會盤算啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.77,0:00:45.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,地下城破壞者也都找好了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.50,0:00:46.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要去的話明天就能出發
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,地下城破壞？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.37,0:00:51.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,聽起來超危險的名字耶…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.22,0:00:53.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,難道說…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是那種滿身肌肉的獨眼巨人？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.95,0:01:09.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,跟你一樣是古代種啦
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.70,0:01:12.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,公會雇來
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.30,0:01:13.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,專門破壞不要的地下城的
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.47,0:01:16.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好帥喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.85,0:01:19.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,話說回來 原來莉露是古代種啊
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.30,0:01:20.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好猛喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.15,0:01:25.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安分點！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.52,0:01:29.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沉睡在莉露體內的龍之力啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.92,0:01:32.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你是怎樣啦莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.27,0:01:34.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也太帥了吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.77,0:01:35.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露她…
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.40,0:01:39.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,得了那種冒險者稍微變強就會犯的病…
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.52,0:01:47.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哼… 我的食人魔之爪將撕裂敵人…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:48.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}（年少時的東雲始）
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.37,0:01:51.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沉眠吧！我的過去！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:52.12,0:01:53.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼！你這大叔也會？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.85,0:01:55.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也想玩！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.37,0:01:58.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,力量要暴走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:33.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:48.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第4話 初戀的去向）
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.30,0:04:04.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好猛！這是什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.97,0:04:06.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是平面型的地下城啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.00,0:04:09.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看起來好清淨喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.42,0:04:10.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別鬆懈！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:43.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}（樁木地下城 卡卡米奈特）
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.47,0:04:44.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,把那傢伙打倒
Dialogue: 2,0:04:45.10,0:04:47.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們就能當上銅等級冒險者了！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！打倒他！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.80,0:04:54.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:55.80,0:04:57.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安揚戈！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:00.17,0:05:00.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好痛！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.07,0:05:01.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.15,0:05:07.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,吃我這招！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.12,0:05:23.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是現在！宰了你！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.70,0:05:24.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,上！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太… 太…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.15,0:05:34.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.02,0:05:47.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,第一次通關地下城 恭喜啦
Dialogue: 2,0:05:56.05,0:05:58.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這下我們也算銅等級冒險者了！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.32,0:06:02.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也可以去做些討伐龍之類任務了吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:02.27,0:06:04.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那也太誇張了啦
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看來到了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:16.80,0:06:18.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,歡迎回來！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.52,0:06:19.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來得正好！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:20.32,0:06:20.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,奇怪？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你們在幹嘛啊
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.67,0:06:31.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.17,0:06:34.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小戈是聰明又溫柔的蛇喔
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.22,0:06:42.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這麼大一條看起來很可怕…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.02,0:06:44.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,該不會牠其實很溫柔？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.65,0:06:46.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,地下城破壞者指的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.22,0:06:49.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是那條啦
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.52,0:06:53.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這位就是…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:54.17,0:06:56.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,地下城破壞者石姬小姐
Dialogue: 2,0:07:08.70,0:07:11.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-莉露別大聲嚷嚷啦！\N- 好厲害喔 好高喔 嗚哇
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.25,0:07:14.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對了 那條蛇是那個啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:14.42,0:07:15.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不只是普通的蛇
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.17,0:07:17.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也是她的“眼睛”…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:20.22,0:07:21.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我下去比較好嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:22.42,0:07:24.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不用喔沒關係的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.75,0:07:27.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝你啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:27.55,0:07:30.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小戈！走囉走囉！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.10,0:07:31.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,美杜莎石姬…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:32.67,0:07:34.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,擁有把映入她眼中的存在
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.65,0:07:38.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,全部化為石頭的能力的古代種
Dialogue: 2,0:07:42.67,0:07:43.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,睡著了？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:43.82,0:07:45.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始 始！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.85,0:07:48.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有個很大的東西在天空飛耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:49.50,0:07:51.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那叫遷徙鯨
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.82,0:07:54.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,遷徙鯨？好吃嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.82,0:07:55.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,超好吃喔
Dialogue: 2,0:07:56.37,0:07:57.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露也要吃！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,都你在吃太不公平了啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:00.10,0:08:02.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,下次帶你去吃啦
Dialogue: 2,0:08:02.47,0:08:03.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,遷徙鯨
Dialogue: 2,0:08:04.75,0:08:08.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,味道的確有點獨特但很好吃呢
Dialogue: 2,0:08:09.75,0:08:11.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但長什麼形狀
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是什麼顏色
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.50,0:08:16.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我就不清楚了…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:23.85,0:08:25.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這個方向對嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:26.45,0:08:28.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就在你正後方
Dialogue: 2,0:08:28.82,0:08:30.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,拜託別往我們這邊看
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.92,0:08:32.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 2,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然早就知道了…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:59.42,0:09:01.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但這不只是強而已啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:09.05,0:09:09.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:09.82,0:09:11.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,地下城要崩塌了！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.35,0:09:30.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她一直都在看天空呢
Dialogue: 2,0:09:30.55,0:09:32.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為幾乎只能看天空啦
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.37,0:09:36.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大姊姊看起來… 有點寂寞耶
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.90,0:09:41.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,古代種的力量…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:42.27,0:09:45.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,以前… 我聽說過美杜莎的傳聞…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:46.20,0:09:48.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是公會雇用的古代種
Dialogue: 2,0:09:48.20,0:09:50.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,作為“地下城破壞者”備受器重
Dialogue: 2,0:09:51.67,0:09:52.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我那時候還想
Dialogue: 2,0:09:53.10,0:09:55.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,吃飯不用愁真是賺到了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:55.90,0:09:57.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,之類的蠢話…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好… 那差不多該睡了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:06.40,0:10:08.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,了解…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:11.37,0:10:15.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始！始！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:16.57,0:10:18.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露？怎樣發生什麼事…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:19.82,0:10:21.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼縮小了！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.35,0:10:24.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,果然是始！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:24.45,0:10:25.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,果然是什麼意思…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:29.52,0:10:31.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,張開眼也不會變成石頭！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:32.37,0:10:33.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,會搖的草！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不可愛的鳥！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:35.97,0:10:36.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這個世界…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:37.62,0:10:39.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也太柔軟了吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:40.32,0:10:42.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也太繽紛了吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:44.10,0:10:47.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我可以確定 這裡發生了非常不尋常的事
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.40,0:10:58.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,超好玩的啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:58.60,0:10:59.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她也太快就適應了…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:00.92,0:11:04.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,美杜莎的眼睛是開著的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:04.57,0:11:07.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但不管怎麼看這裡都不是現實世界…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:10.40,0:11:11.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,史萊姆長這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:12.62,0:11:15.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這就是傳聞中QQ彈彈的那個？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:17.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}（她所熟悉的史萊姆（石頭））
Dialogue: 2,0:11:18.25,0:11:20.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊！對付史萊姆要安靜…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,給我站住！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:31.22,0:11:33.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-謝謝你 不知名的少年\N-別跑！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:35.67,0:11:37.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來世界…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:37.47,0:11:39.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,竟是如此有趣的東西啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:40.27,0:11:42.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我到現在才知道呢
Dialogue: 2,0:11:42.97,0:11:46.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,接下來到那邊去
Dialogue: 2,0:11:46.42,0:11:48.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.57,0:12:10.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:10.55,0:12:12.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是超大水窪耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.75,0:12:13.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是海啦
Dialogue: 2,0:12:13.55,0:12:15.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,海？是喔？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.02,0:12:18.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,果然這就是… 傳說中的…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:18.50,0:12:20.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊！莉露之前就在這裡
Dialogue: 2,0:12:20.25,0:12:22.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,遇到超大的烏龜喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:33.62,0:12:35.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是中午看到的那隻鯨魚！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:43.07,0:12:43.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:45.10,0:12:46.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太感動了…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也太壯觀了吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.47,0:12:51.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也太震撼了吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:51.42,0:12:53.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是說啊 就是說啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.97,0:12:57.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過這地方
Dialogue: 2,0:12:57.65,0:12:59.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露好像很熟耶…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,難不成這不是我的夢…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:06.62,0:13:08.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露！你手臂上的紋章…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:09.42,0:13:12.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有奇怪的圖案耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,學到特殊技能的時候
Dialogue: 2,0:13:15.40,0:13:16.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就會浮出來的紋章！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:17.10,0:13:19.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡的右胸上面也有吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個愛心形狀的
Dialogue: 2,0:13:24.42,0:13:27.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,夢… 技能… 古代種…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:29.65,0:13:31.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我懂了！夢魔！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:32.60,0:13:33.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,夢魔？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:33.70,0:13:35.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是魅魔的別稱啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.82,0:13:36.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我從奧利弗那聽說
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.00,0:13:40.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,以前也有能操作夢境世界的魅魔喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.17,0:13:45.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這麼說來 這個美好的夢
Dialogue: 2,0:13:45.85,0:13:47.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是莉露你讓我看到的囉？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:51.42,0:13:53.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是當個很棒的冒險者的夢…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.92,0:13:55.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝你莉露
Dialogue: 2,0:13:56.75,0:13:57.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這就是…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露身為古代種的力量…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:02.37,0:14:04.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不客氣啦大姊姊！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:06.15,0:14:07.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,回復原狀了？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:10.55,0:14:12.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你是我的菜耶
Dialogue: 2,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請務必跟我交往！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:18.20,0:14:18.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:25.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）
Dialogue: 2,0:14:26.65,0:14:29.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,世上似乎有種東西叫做愛
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.05,0:14:32.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,東雲先生
Dialogue: 2,0:14:34.35,0:14:36.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,您大概什麼時候回來呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:41.35,0:14:43.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,傍晚左右吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:43.72,0:14:45.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那我等您喔
Dialogue: 2,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那我先走了…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:02.10,0:15:03.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是拿她沒辦法…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-雖然以前也算受歡迎\N-東雲先生！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:06.05,0:15:07.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-但怎麼說呢… 不太一樣…\N-幫你打折喔
Dialogue: 2,0:15:08.02,0:15:10.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總覺得跟這次不太一樣…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:10.90,0:15:12.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請務必跟我交往！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:13.52,0:15:15.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,欸 東雲先生！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,到底發生什麼事啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:18.62,0:15:22.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總覺得今天莉露有點可怕…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:25.55,0:15:29.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有事就跟我說吧 我們是同伴吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:30.75,0:15:31.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:33.02,0:15:34.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼樣啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:34.65,0:15:35.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是那個大姊姊？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:36.17,0:15:37.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大姊姊？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:39.52,0:15:40.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:40.95,0:15:43.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,打個比方 要是你們長大之後
Dialogue: 2,0:15:43.75,0:15:45.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喜歡上我了呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:46.82,0:15:48.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,既然對我有好感
Dialogue: 2,0:15:49.87,0:15:52.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那我免費摸一下屁股也可以吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:57.47,0:15:59.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她們看我的眼神跟看蟲一樣
Dialogue: 2,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,史萊姆還真多啊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:04.75,0:16:07.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對了 石姬小姐
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.27,0:16:09.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好像還住在旅館呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:10.40,0:16:13.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她跟我告白了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.90,0:16:16.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,告… 告白？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:19.35,0:16:20.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那可真是…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.97,0:16:22.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總之啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.45,0:16:24.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想了一整天…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:27.10,0:16:28.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 2,0:16:29.35,0:16:32.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,東雲先生真是個受歡迎的美男子呢
Dialogue: 2,0:16:33.80,0:16:35.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不管怎樣
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.27,0:16:38.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,千萬別惹她生氣然後被變成石頭喔
Dialogue: 2,0:16:38.60,0:16:40.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,愛情… 真難啊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:43.70,0:16:44.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,東雲先生
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.65,0:16:48.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天也辛苦了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:58.72,0:17:00.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,杯子沒對準啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:01.90,0:17:04.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想試試看詩人歌裡唱的那種倒酒
Dialogue: 2,0:17:04.85,0:17:06.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,結果沒倒好…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.15,0:17:08.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有趣嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:09.65,0:17:13.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有！其實你的聲音也很對我胃口！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:13.87,0:17:15.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天跟娜塔莉小姐聊天
Dialogue: 2,0:17:15.90,0:17:17.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,聽她說了平常的你
Dialogue: 2,0:17:17.40,0:17:18.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是怎麼樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:19.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}（愛聊戀愛話題）
Dialogue: 2,0:17:21.05,0:17:23.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為是初戀 我可能有點飄飄然
Dialogue: 2,0:17:26.95,0:17:28.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好啦 不好意思
Dialogue: 2,0:17:28.87,0:17:30.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這傢伙先借我一下
Dialogue: 2,0:17:31.17,0:17:32.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你幹嘛啊 薇洛妮卡！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:36.20,0:17:38.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我都聽說了 人家跟你告白了對吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:39.67,0:17:40.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 2,0:17:41.40,0:17:42.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼做？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:43.65,0:17:46.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你這麼問我也很難回答啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:46.65,0:17:47.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,給我拒絕！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:47.45,0:17:50.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為什麼我要聽你的…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:51.20,0:17:53.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你跟我是青梅竹馬耶
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.60,0:17:55.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們也認識很久了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:56.70,0:17:58.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是美麗的魅魔…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:59.10,0:18:01.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很多男人都愛上過我
Dialogue: 2,0:18:03.80,0:18:04.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:04.84,0:18:07.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只有你始終不為我所動…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.32,0:18:09.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:10.50,0:18:12.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你給我先愛上我！就先愛我！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:13.02,0:18:14.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,然後我馬上把你甩掉！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:14.80,0:18:15.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.42,0:18:17.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不然我的自尊會受傷！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我把你甩掉之後你再去跟她交往！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:19.95,0:18:21.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你到底在說什麼啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:21.67,0:18:22.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:24.15,0:18:24.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:27.05,0:18:28.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:30.25,0:18:31.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:31.62,0:18:33.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要當超厲害的冒險者！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:33.92,0:18:35.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然現在還是小孩子
Dialogue: 2,0:18:35.92,0:18:38.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但會變得很強 會變得超級漂亮
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.45,0:18:40.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,胸部也會長大的啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:40.70,0:18:44.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以… 所以東雲你…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:52.37,0:18:53.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:58.20,0:18:58.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:02.22,0:19:03.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,至少現在…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:04.85,0:19:08.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我還想跟這小不點一起過冒險的日子…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.12,0:19:18.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,方便聊一下嗎？ 石姬
Dialogue: 2,0:19:21.85,0:19:22.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:36.15,0:19:39.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我聽見了駒井村的夜之聲
Dialogue: 2,0:19:40.00,0:19:44.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,簡直就像詩裡寫的幽會呢
Dialogue: 2,0:19:45.20,0:19:46.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:48.42,0:19:49.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這不是約會
Dialogue: 2,0:19:58.17,0:19:59.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是不是… 讓您覺得困擾了…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:00.60,0:20:03.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是 也不至於說困擾…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:04.85,0:20:07.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但我也沒有想跟你交往
Dialogue: 2,0:20:08.15,0:20:10.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我對那種事不是很懂
Dialogue: 2,0:20:12.72,0:20:14.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以抱歉了
Dialogue: 2,0:20:28.75,0:20:31.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,比想像中還要難受耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:31.52,0:20:32.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:32.72,0:20:35.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好痛苦！超級傷心欸！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:39.47,0:20:40.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,吃… 吃個飯就會好點…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:40.97,0:20:42.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,誰吃得下去啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:43.52,0:20:45.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我好痛苦！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:45.67,0:20:47.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太悲劇啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:51.75,0:20:53.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,冷靜！石姬！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.47,0:20:55.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你的能力在失控啦！！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:55.25,0:20:56.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我控制不住啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:56.92,0:20:59.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,現在就是不管怎樣都超級悲傷！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:01.85,0:21:03.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可惡！這樣下去不行！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:06.00,0:21:07.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我懂了！那就交往吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:08.22,0:21:09.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:15.17,0:21:16.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,交往就是那個意思吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:17.50,0:21:19.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,胸部啊屁股啊可以免費摸
Dialogue: 2,0:21:20.27,0:21:23.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不用花錢就能做大人的冒險那種！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:28.12,0:21:31.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 2,0:21:34.60,0:21:36.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總覺得… 有點對不起…
Dialogue: 2,0:21:42.12,0:21:44.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你也太沒分寸了吧…
Dialogue: 2,0:21:44.97,0:21:47.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你太讚了！東雲！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:52.25,0:21:54.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,放心啦 始！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:54.75,0:21:58.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我一輩子都會照顧你的啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:22:00.52,0:22:01.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,愛情果然很難
Dialogue: 2,0:22:03.97,0:22:04.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}（下回 孵化出來的是）
